  "abstract": "Fix SAP-Fourier degradation by gating only encoder U (no decode gating), adding a constant trend per factor, and initializing \u03b3 to a 0.25\u21920.99 ramp. Fourier basis (cos/sin) with LN in factor space; residual copy head; Adam lr=9e-4 with global clip=1.0; MAE+temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4). Exports gate stats.",
